{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:207","content":{"id":207,"title":"23 抗体","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4e4092bc-2d4c-4463-8805-a7254474b0d3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"常见抗体长得像有两只钳子的小龙虾，体积很小，抗体具有针对性，会吧相应的病原体都洗出来，然后用小钳子紧紧抓住，一旦和病原体结合，就不会松手。抗体尾端可以方便地结合到免疫细胞上。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7caee746-5f05-4797-b7dc-1f6d5e3e968c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"抗体的作用："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"843f916c-0582-4f49-bf31-133f370bffcd","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7959aecb-5791-442a-a41a-7f94e6339b36","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"70a8aae6-38c6-4a14-a919-602cf0ab6c58","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"调理病原体，抓住敌人，让免疫细胞觉得敌人更美味"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"0a7a2b1f-2e51-4c25-bb4e-8b5eaebdeb9a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0ec09bc5-855a-445b-8fb1-b5a282192d28","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"攻击敌人，如果是病毒，抗体会直接中和病毒"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b2638321-ccc3-4d04-917c-4d72486a8155","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c6bb4133-ddab-4aaf-9395-88e9759976c5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"抗体有两个钳子，可以同时抓住两个敌人，几百万抗体可以把大量病原体黏在一起，铁索连环，然后巨噬细胞和中性粒细胞就可以更容易发现，然后干掉他们"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"033dd6b1-b2c2-4a8a-adfc-43e24b31505e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1a03aea0-bd51-49ae-afb6-71c59315879b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"抗体可以直接支援免疫细胞，病原体不太好抓，浑身是油，抗原像强力胶黏上，然后尾端和免疫细胞结合，就好抓了"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b4980628-f14b-4c8d-8c7d-9b1d1be18b86","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"489f3cfb-380e-4cde-a88f-3e2b285b00f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"尾端还可以激活补体系统，将补体引向细菌"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"015d6786-c8f8-43db-9020-0e458b2ae27d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"先天性免疫系统负责作战，适应性系统让进攻更快、更准、更狠。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d7ba48b1-40de-41a5-8dae-bbf5ffd454bc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第二部分，惨重损伤"},{"label":"23 抗体","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:207","type":"doc","id":207}}],"prevPage":{"title":"22 T 细胞和 B 细胞的共舞","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:206","type":"doc","id":206}},"nextPage":{"title":"24 沼泽之国：黏膜","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:210","type":"doc","id":210}},"createTime":1741567269899,"updateTime":1756124030450,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1756124030450}}